  "body": "Welcome to an extraordinary standard of modern coastal living 39 Streamview Way. Positioned in one of Long Bay’s premier streets, this brand-new, two-level residence architectural design with imported Italian marble and smart home automation. Every fixture and finish has been carefully selected for the discerning buyer seeking luxury, convenience, and security.\r\n\r\nPremium Property Features\r\n· Gourmet Miele Kitchen: Fully equipped with high-spec, built-in Miele appliances, including an integrated refrigerator, oven, steam oven, coffee machine, and gourmet plate warming drawer.\r\n· High-Spec Finishes: Premium bathrooms and living accents highlighted by genuine imported Italian marble benches, Australia timber flooring. \r\n\r\n Flexible 5-Bedroom Layout:\r\n• 4 upstairs bedrooms including 2 feature private en-suite bathrooms. \r\n • 1 ground-floor bedroom suite—ideal for elderly family members, teenagers, guests, or a dedicated home office.\r\n• Total of 4.5 bathrooms for absolute convenience.\r\n•  3 Generous Living Zones: Ample space for formal entertaining, casual family relaxation, and a private retreat upstairs.\r\n•  Dedicated Separate Laundry: Complete functional layout with a dedicated laundry room.\r\n•  Sun-Drenched Landscaped Garden: Beautifully designed outdoor space featuring established planting and fruit-bearing plum trees, enjoying exceptional all-day sunshine.\r\n\r\nIntegrated Smart Home & Security System\r\n• Enjoy complete control of your home from your smartphone, wherever you are in the world:\r\n • Remote Access Control: Operate the automated security gate, garage door, and home lighting remotely.\r\n•  Comprehensive Security: Multi-camera CCTV monitoring system paired with a secure electronic entry gate.\r\n• Ambient Audio: Built-in background speaker system streaming audio seamlessly throughout the home.\r\n• Garaging: Internal access garage providing direct, secure entry into the residence.\r\n\r\nSituated within close proximity to the pristine shores of Long Bay Beach, the Regional Park, vibrant local village dining, and top-tier local schooling.\r\n\r\nExperience this masterpiece in person. Contact us today to secure a private viewing or join us at the upcoming open homes.",
